  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In April 2024, Laura Stanton said GSA’s generative AI acquisition resource guide was a start to help the acquisition community enable agencies to responsibly harness the technology. In July 2026, she said GSA’s partnership with CORAS expands AI-enabled capabilities available to agencies as they evaluate solutions for mission and operational requirements. In September 2026, she said OneGov AI deals were launched so agencies could try new technologies before committing to lengthy acquisitions, and that consumption-based access is the next logical step as agencies increasingly integrate AI.",
   "sids": [
    "s10",
    "s1",
    "s7"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In April 2024, Laura Stanton said GSA’s generative AI acquisition resource guide was a start to help the acquisition community enable agencies to responsibly harness the technology.",
